  "visible_text_excerpt": "Skip to Main Content Log in Quiz progress 1 of 8 Help us match you to the right therapist It's important to have a therapist who you can establish a personal connection with. The following questions are designed to match you to a licensed therapist based on your therapy needs and personal preferences. What type of therapy are you looking for? Individual (for myself) Couples (for myself and my partner) Teen (for my child) Let's walk through the process of finding the best therapist for you! We'll start off with some basic questions. The role of AI in identifying a therapist We strive to connect you with a therapist who aligns with your needs and preferences. To make this process as smooth as possible, we use automated tools, including... Read more Reviews Slide 1 of 4 LATEST REVIEW FOR: BRYAN HIXSON C.L. wrote 47 days ago: Feel seen and heard- Bryan provides practical advice; he is compassionate and very thorough with his therapeutic approach. Thank you! LATEST REVIEW FOR: TIFFANY WILHELM J.O. wrote 47 days ago: I met Tiffany at my lowest in life, 6 months later I’m finally living the life I want. From day I she made me feel heard and with her help I have improved in all aspects of my life. LATEST REVIEW FOR: ROBERTO DIAZ (LMHC ,LPC,NCC) C.E. wrote 15 days ago: Roberto is a great therapist. He listens to my concerns and provides good feedback and ideas to resolve emotional issues. Thank you. LATEST REVIEW FOR: ANGELA DASILVA T.I. wrote 15 days ago: Angela is exactly the kind of therapist I was hoping to work with. Angela is not afraid to give practical homework and ask pointed questions. I could not be happier, both during and after my sessions, as I know I am always working towards a goal. LATEST REVIEW FOR: ASHLEY BRUMMETT (LCSW,MSW,BSW) S.H. wrote 31 days ago: Ashley is wonderful. I have been with her for a few years now and I have always appreciated her expertise and support. It has helped me tremendously and I appreciate her so much! LATEST REVIEW FOR: JEANETTE JOYNER S.H. wrote 43 days ago: She was very sweet and kind and understanding as well. I liked talking to her. I could feel that she truly cares. Thank you Ms. Joyner. LATEST REVIEW FOR: LATRICE TODD A.N. wrote 45 days ago: Latrice actively listens and offers empathetic, helpful feedback that is helping me make progress towards my mental health goals. LATEST REVIEW FOR: THOMAS MOORE B.L. wrote 45 days ago: I am so very thankful for the time I have with Thomas. He is very professional honest and provided me with so many resources and tools to become a better me. LATEST REVIEW FOR: BRYAN HIXSON C.L. wrote 47 days ago: Feel seen and heard- Bryan provides practical advice; he is compassionate and very thorough with his therapeutic approach. Thank you! LATEST REVIEW FOR: TIFFANY WILHELM J.O. wrote 47 days ago: I met Tiffany at my lowest in life, 6 months later I’m finally living the life I want. From day I she made me feel heard and with her help I have improved in all aspects of my life. LATEST REVIEW FOR: ROBERTO DIAZ (LMHC ,LPC,NCC) C.E. wrote 15 days ago: Roberto is a great therapist. He listens to my concerns and provides good feedback and ideas to resolve emotional issues. Thank you. LATEST REVIEW FOR: ANGELA DASILVA T.I. wrote 15 days ago: Angela is exactly the kind of therapist I was hoping to work with. Angela is not afraid to give practical homework and ask pointed questions. I could not be happier, both during and after my sessions, as I know I am always working towards a goal. If you are in a crisis or any other person may be in danger - don't use this site. These resources can provide you with immediate help. Home Business About FAQ Reviews Advice Careers Find a Therapist Online Therapy Contact For Therapists AARP Terms & Conditions Privacy Policy Health Data Do Not Sell My Information Web Accessibility © 2026 BetterHelp [redacted-secret] We process personally identifiable and personal health information to conduct our business, as 